  "body": "Push non-void elements onto the stack of open elements before DOM insertion across HTML (`insert a foreign element`, `\"before html\"` `<html>`, and `\"in head\"` `<script>`) and XML start-tag parsing, and introduce an `insert a void HTML element` helper so void HTML elements (including `<form>` in `\"in table\"`) are never transiently pushed onto the stack of open elements before being popped.\n\nThis ensures algorithms and callbacks that run during insertion (such as `style` element updates and custom element `connectedCallback()`) observe the newly created non-void element on the stack of open elements.\n\nTests: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/65541.\nPart of #13282.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium (already implements this behavior)\n   * Gecko (already implements this behavior)\n   * WebKit: …\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/65541\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: already matching\n   * Gecko: already matching\n   * WebKit: …\n- [x] Corresponding [HTML AAM](https://w3c.github.io/html-aam/) & [ARIA in HTML](https://w3c.github.io/html-aria/) issues & PRs: N/A\n- [x] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: N/A\n- [x] The top of this comment includes a [clear commit message](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/COMMITTING.md) to use.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13308/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 8:27 PM UTC (750ca51)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13308/3941bb4...750ca51/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 8:27 PM UTC (750ca51)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13308/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 8:27 PM UTC (750ca51)\">/xhtml.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13308/3941bb4...750ca51/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 8:27 PM UTC (750ca51)\">diff</a> )",
